      "byline": "The Wire",
      "headline": "testf Left Waiting on a Certificate Check",
      "deck": "Xhaka, owned by testf, under investigation over his Covid-19 vaccination certificate; no line on availability.",
      "body": "The wire has Granit Xhaka under investigation over an issue with his Covid-19 vaccination certificate. He is testf's, and that is the whole of the draft stake: the league leaders in points scored have a captain in the headlines for something no one has yet attached a timescale to.\n\nWhat it costs testf, nobody can say. The report offers no ban, no missed fixture, no line on availability. Until it does, Xhaka is a name in an investigation and not a name out of a line-up, and testf plan around him as before.",
      "subjects": [
        "news:https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/football/articles/c3qjkpgengn7o"
      ],
